# Card and Profile Design Standards

These standards ensure cards and profiles follow the "Purpose Dialog" quality level with proper whitespace, brand color integration, and warm typography.

## 1. Whitespace Philosophy

**PRINCIPLE: Let content breathe.** Dense information creates cognitive overload.

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Generous spacing
<Card className="p-6 space-y-6">
  <div className="space-y-4">
    <h3 className="text-lg font-semibold">Section Title</h3>
    <p className="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
      Content with room to breathe.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>

// ❌ WRONG - Cramped spacing
<Card className="p-3 space-y-2">
  <h3 className="text-sm font-bold">SECTION</h3>
  <p className="text-xs">{content}</p>
</Card>
```

**Spacing scale:**
- Card padding: `p-6` (not `p-3` or `p-4`)
- Section gaps: `space-y-6` or `space-y-8`
- Internal content: `space-y-4`
- Tight groups: `space-y-2`

## 2. Brand Color Integration

**PRINCIPLE: International Orange is our brand. Use it consistently, not competing colors.**

### Role Colors (CRITICAL FIX)

All human roles should use **international-orange** or **neutral** colors, not competing hues:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Orange/neutral for roles
const ROLE_STYLES = {
  'Founder': 'bg-orange-100 text-orange-700',      // Primary decision makers
  'Executive': 'bg-orange-50 text-orange-600',     // Supporting leadership
  'Apprentice': 'bg-muted text-muted-foreground',  // Neutral
  'AI_Agent': 'bg-violet-100 text-violet-700',     // AI gets distinct violet
} satisfies Record<string, string>

// ❌ WRONG - Competing brand colors
const ROLE_STYLES = {
  'Founder': 'bg-purple-100 text-purple-700',   // Purple fights with brand
  'Executive': 'bg-orange-100 text-orange-700',
  'Apprentice': 'bg-blue-100 text-blue-700',   // Blue fights with brand
  'AI_Agent': 'bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700',
}
```

### Avatar Gradients

Human users should use **orange-based** gradients or **neutral**:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Brand-consistent avatars
function getAvatarBackground(role: string): string {
  switch (role) {
    case 'Founder':
      return 'bg-international-orange'
    case 'Executive':
      return 'bg-international-orange/80'
    case 'Apprentice':
      return 'bg-muted'
    case 'AI_Agent':
      return 'bg-violet-500'  // AI agents get violet
    default:
      return 'bg-muted'
  }
}

// ❌ WRONG - Rainbow of competing colors
function getAvatarGradient(role: string): string {
  switch (role) {
    case 'Founder':
      return 'from-purple-400 to-purple-600'  // Purple fights brand
    case 'Apprentice':
      return 'from-blue-400 to-blue-600'      // Blue fights brand
  }
}
```

### Button Accents

Primary actions should use brand orange:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Brand orange CTA
<Button className="bg-international-orange hover:bg-international-orange-hover">
  View Details
</Button>

// Or use default variant which should be properly themed:
<Button variant="default">View Details</Button>

// ❌ WRONG - Default blue (unthemed)
<Button className="bg-blue-500">View Details</Button>
```

## 3. Typography: Warm, Not Technical

**PRINCIPLE: Use conversational headings, not cold uppercase labels.**

### Section Headers

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Conversational, warm headers
<h3 className="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">
  About
</h3>
<p className="text-muted-foreground">
  Tell us about yourself...
</p>

// ❌ WRONG - Cold, technical uppercase
<h3 className="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground uppercase tracking-wider">
  ABOUT
</h3>
```

### When Uppercase IS Acceptable

- Very small labels: `<Badge className="uppercase text-[9px]">Founder</Badge>`
- Navigation category headers
- Status indicators

But **never** for section headings like "About", "Teams", "Tasks".

## 4. Card Section Pattern

Use this pattern for content sections:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Warm, spacious section
<div className="space-y-4">
  <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
    <h3 className="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">
      Teams
    </h3>
    <Badge variant="secondary">{teams.length}</Badge>
  </div>
  
  <div className="space-y-3">
    {teams.map(team => (
      <div 
        key={team.id}
        className="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-lg bg-muted/50"
      >
        <span className="font-medium">{team.name}</span>
        <span className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Joined 3 days ago
        </span>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Technical, cramped section
<div>
  <h2 className="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
    <Users className="h-4 w-4" /> TEAMS
    <Badge>{teams.length}</Badge>
  </h2>
  <div className="bg-background border border-slate-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
    {teams.map(team => (
      <div className="p-4 border-b border-slate-100 last:border-0">
        ...
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</div>
```

## 5. Profile Card Pattern

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Warm, spacious profile card
<Card className="p-6">
  <div className="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
    <UserAvatar name={name} role={role} size="lg" />
    <div className="flex-1 min-w-0">
      <div className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
        <Badge 
          variant="secondary" 
          className="bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 font-medium"
        >
          {role}
        </Badge>
      </div>
      <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        {name}
      </h3>
      <p className="text-muted-foreground">{email}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  {/* Spacious metrics */}
  <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 p-4 rounded-lg bg-muted/50 mb-6">
    <div className="text-center">
      <div className="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">{completed}</div>
      <div className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Completed</div>
    </div>
    ...
  </div>
  
  {/* Action footer */}
  <div className="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-4 border-t">
    <Button variant="secondary">Message</Button>
    <Button className="bg-international-orange hover:bg-international-orange-hover">
      View Details
    </Button>
  </div>
</Card>
```

## 6. Metrics Display

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Clean, spacious metrics
<div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 p-6 rounded-xl bg-muted/30">
  <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
    <div className="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-status-success-light">
      <CheckCircle2 className="h-5 w-5 text-status-success" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <div className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Completed</div>
      <div className="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">{count}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Cramped metrics
<div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-3 p-3 bg-muted">
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
    <CheckCircle2 className="h-4 w-4 text-status-success" />
    <div>
      <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Completed</p>
      <p className="text-sm font-medium">{count}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

## 7. Empty States

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Inviting empty state
<div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 text-center">
  <div className="p-4 rounded-full bg-muted/50 mb-4">
    <Users className="h-8 w-8 text-muted-foreground" />
  </div>
  <h4 className="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mb-1">
    No teams yet
  </h4>
  <p className="text-muted-foreground max-w-sm">
    Add this person to a team to start collaborating.
  </p>
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Cold empty state
<div className="p-8 text-center text-muted-foreground">
  Not on any teams yet
</div>
```

## Quick Checklist

Before committing any card or profile component:

- [ ] Padding uses `p-6` not `p-3` or `p-4`
- [ ] Section gaps use `space-y-6` not `space-y-2` or `space-y-4`
- [ ] Role badges use orange or neutral (not purple/blue)
- [ ] Avatar colors use brand orange or neutral (not purple/blue)
- [ ] Section headers are sentence case, not UPPERCASE
- [ ] Primary buttons use `bg-international-orange`
- [ ] Borders use `border` semantic token (not `border-slate-*`)
- [ ] Empty states have icon, heading, and description
- [ ] Metrics have adequate spacing (`gap-6` not `gap-3`)

## Anti-Patterns

| Anti-Pattern | Problem | Solution |
|--------------|---------|----------|
| `uppercase tracking-wider` on headings | Cold, technical | Sentence case |
| `bg-purple-*` for roles | Competes with brand | `bg-orange-*` |
| `bg-blue-*` for roles | Competes with brand | `bg-muted` |
| `p-3` card padding | Too cramped | `p-6` |
| `space-y-2` section gaps | Too dense | `space-y-6` |
| `border-slate-200` | Hardcoded | `border` semantic |
| Text-only empty states | Uninviting | Icon + heading + description |

## Reference

The "Purpose Dialog" (`src/components/objectives/company-purpose-dialog.tsx`) demonstrates these principles:
- Generous whitespace
- Conversational typography
- Brand orange accent
- One focus per section
- Warm, inviting tone
